  <ul class="key-takeaways">
    <li>Reuse &gt; resale &gt; recycling in terms of environmental impact hierarchy.</li>
    <li>Reuse means the device keeps its original function with a new owner.</li>
    <li>Resale means someone pays for the device to use themselves.</li>
    <li>Recycling means materials are recovered because the device is past use.</li>
    <li>Most workflows combine: buyback for viable units, recycling for the rest.</li>
  </ul>

